  "description": "PR #2109 (merge commit 2a380b290830b60a7152dcf8f70db8ddb76292e7, merged 2026-11-11T07:39:51Z for gh-2106) fixed the v1.0.707 Build iOS failure in flutter_app/ios/Podfile + committed pbxproj; the sibling DerivedData disk-I/O class (v1.0.712) was fixed by gh-2134's checkout-scoped wipe. Post-fix trains v1.0.710-711 and v1.0.713-716 all went green; latest published release v1.0.716 supersedes v1.0.707 (rerun moot). The stale draft itself was deleted by the sweep that filed this ticket.",
  "verification_test": "test/wasmrun_ios_pod_link_test.dart (3/3 green on this tree; also test/ci_build_ios_derivedata_wipe_guard_test.dart 9/9 and test/release_hygiene_test.dart 57/57)"
}

