{
  "commit": "2a380b2",
  "rca": "Tag train v1.0.707 failed at Build iOS with `Library 'wasm_run_dart' not found` (poisoned per-checkout DerivedData left the pod's XCFrameworkIntermediates copy unlanded, killing the `-l\"wasm_run_dart\"` link); its staging draft v1.0.707 then rotted past 24h and the sweeper filed gh-2150 — the root cause was already fixed by merged PR #2109 (LIBRARY_SEARCH_PATHS pinned at the vendored slices) before this ticket was filed.",
  "description": "PR #2109 (merge commit 2a380b290830b60a7152dcf8f70db8ddb76292e7, merged 2026-11-11T07:39:51Z for gh-2106) fixed the v1.0.707 Build iOS failure in flutter_app/ios/Podfile + committed pbxproj; the sibling DerivedData disk-I/O class (v1.0.712) was fixed by gh-2134's checkout-scoped wipe. Fix verified present on the leg branch AND on current origin/main (9ab55d39, #2149). Post-fix trains v1.0.710-711 and v1.0.713-716 all went green; latest published release v1.0.716 supersedes v1.0.707 (rerun moot). The stale draft itself was deleted by the sweep that filed this ticket.",
  "verification_test": "test/wasmrun_ios_pod_link_test.dart (3/3 green on this tree; also test/ci_build_ios_derivedata_wipe_guard_test.dart 9/9 and test/release_hygiene_test.dart 57/57)"
}

